{"id": "bcafe7b5-21a0-4ae0-8198-8da571b8a52a", "slug": "deep-view-infrastructure", "title": "Deep View Infrastructure", "description": "Deep View Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Deep View Infrastructure\"\ndescription: \"Deep View Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#3B82F6\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#EF4444\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#222222\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#333333\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Deep View Infrastructure\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 11; favorites: 3; remixes: 1.\nTags: pricing, section, css, plans, billing, conversion.\n## Overview\nDeep View Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\n\nNexus Features Documentation Pricing Changelog Log in Sign Up Nexus Engine v2.0 is live Visualize your systems in infinite depth. A spatial observability platform that maps your entire microservice architecture, databas…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Visualize your systems in infinite depth..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #3B82F6, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #EF4444, background #FFFFFF, surface #222222, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Deep View Infrastructure</title>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Tailwind Config for specific theme values -->\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                        mono: ['JetBrains Mono', 'monospace'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        gray: {\n                            950: '#0a0a0a',\n                            900: '#111111',\n                            800: '#222222',\n                            700: '#333333',\n                            400: '#888888',\n                            200: '#ededed',\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-gray-950 text-gray-200 overflow-hidden w-screen h-screen relative font-sans selection:bg-white/20 selection:text-white flex flex-col\">\n\n    <!-- Ambient Center Glow -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 0%, transparent 60%);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- 3D Tunnel Scene Container -->\n    <div id=\"scene\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\" style=\"perspective: 800px; perspective-origin: 50% 50%;\">\n        <div id=\"tunnel\" class=\"relative w-full h-full\" style=\"transform-style: preserve-3d;\">\n            <!-- Panels injected via JavaScript -->\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Navigation Overlay -->\n    <nav class=\"relative z-50 flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-5 border-b border-white/5 bg-gray-950/30 backdrop-blur-md pointer-events-auto\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded bg-white flex items-center justify-center text-gray-950\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-minimalistic-linear\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight text-white\">Nexus</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-6 text-sm font-medium text-gray-400\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Features</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Documentation</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Pricing</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Changelog</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors hidden sm:block\">Log in</a>\n            <button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-md bg-white text-gray-950 font-medium text-xs hover:bg-gray-200 transition-colors\">\n                Sign Up\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Hero Content Overlay -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-40 flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center px-4 pointer-events-none\">\n        <div class=\"pointer-events-auto flex flex-col items-center\">\n\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-xs font-medium text-gray-400 mb-8 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-all backdrop-blur-md\">\n                <span class=\"flex h-2 w-2 relative\">\n                    <span class=\"animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-blue-400 opacity-75\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-blue-500\"></span>\n                </span>\n                Nexus Engine v2.0 is live\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-[10px]\"></iconify-icon>\n            </a>\n\n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white mb-6 max-w-4xl leading-[1.1]\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\">\n                Visualize your systems in infinite depth.\n            </h1>\n\n            <p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-gray-400 mb-10 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed\">\n                A spatial observability platform that maps your entire microservice architecture, databases, and edge nodes into a unified, navigable environment. Stop reading logs, start flying through them.\n            </p>\n\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4 w-full sm:w-auto\">\n                <button class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3 rounded-md bg-white text-gray-950 font-medium text-sm hover:bg-gray-200 transition-colors shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n                    Deploy to Production\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3 rounded-md bg-gray-900/50 border border-white/10 text-white font-medium text-sm hover:bg-gray-800/50 hover:border-white/20 transition-colors backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:terminal-linear\"></iconify-icon>\n                    Read the Docs\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Background Gradient for bottom fade -->\n    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-32 bg-gradient-to-t from-gray-950 to-transparent z-10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n    <!-- JavaScript for 3D Tunnel Logic -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            const tunnel = document.getElementById('tunnel');\n            const scene = document.getElementById('scene');\n\n            // Panel Content Generators\n            const generators = {\n                chart: () => `\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-gray-200\">Request Latency</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-square-linear\" class=\"text-blue-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-end gap-1.5 h-16 w-full\">\n                        ${Array.from({length: 8}).map(() => `<div class=\"w-full bg-gray-700 hover:bg-blue-500/50 transition-colors rounded-t-sm\" style=\"height: ${Math.random() * 60 + 20}%\"></div>`).join('')}\n                    </div>\n                `,\n                stats: () => `\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between w-full\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 font-medium\">Active Nodes</span>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-square-linear\" class=\"text-gray-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-3xl font-medium text-white tracking-tight mt-1\">1,024</span>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[10px] text-emerald-400 mt-2\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:trend-up-linear\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span>+12.5% scaling event</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                `,\n                code: () => `\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3 border-b border-white/5 pb-2\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:code-square-linear\" class=\"text-gray-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium text-gray-200\">router.ts</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-gray-400 flex flex-col gap-1.5\">\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-blue-400\">export const</span> <span class=\"text-yellow-200\">handler</span> <span class=\"text-gray-200\">=</span> <span>(req)</span> <span class=\"text-blue-400\">=></span> <span>{</span></div>\n                        <div class=\"pl-3 flex gap-2\"><span class=\"text-purple-400\">try</span> <span>{</span></div>\n                        <div class=\"pl-6 text-gray-200\">await process(req.body);</div>\n                        <div class=\"pl-3 flex gap-2\">} <span class=\"text-purple-400\">catch</span> <span>(e) {</span></div>\n                        <div class=\"pl-6 text-red-400\">capture(e);</div>\n                        <div class=\"pl-3\">}</div>\n                        <div>}</div>\n                    </div>\n                `,\n                status: () => `\n                    <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-gray-200\">Database Sync</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-400\">eu-central-1</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex h-2 w-2 relative mt-1\">\n                            <span class=\"animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75\"></span>\n                            <span class=\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-emerald-500\"></span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"w-full bg-gray-800 h-1 rounded-full overflow-hidden mt-4\">\n                        <div class=\"w-[85%] h-full bg-emerald-500 rounded-full\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between text-[9px] text-gray-400 mt-2\">\n                        <span>Progress</span>\n                        <span>85%</span>\n                    </div>\n                `,\n                alert: () => `\n                    <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n                        <div class=\"p-1.5 rounded bg-red-500/10 text-red-400\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:danger-triangle-linear\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white\">Memory Spike</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-400 leading-relaxed\">Pod worker-03 exceeding memory limits. Eviction imminent.</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                `\n            };\n\n            const panelTypes = Object.keys(generators);\n            const numPanels = window.innerWidth < 768 ? 25 : 45; // Fewer panels on mobile for performance\n            const maxDepth = 4000;\n            const panels = [];\n\n            // Generate Panels\n            for (let i = 0; i < numPanels; i++) {\n                const el = document.createElement('div');\n                const type = panelTypes[Math.floor(Math.random() * panelTypes.length)];\n\n                // Base classes for UI panels\n                el.className = 'absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 w-64 p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-gray-900/60 backdrop-blur-md shadow-[0_4px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] flex flex-col will-change-transform';\n\n                // Add subtle specific glows based on type\n                if(type === 'alert') el.classList.add('shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(239,68,68,0.05)]', 'border-red-500/10');\n                if(type === 'chart') el.classList.add('shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(59,130,246,0.05)]');\n\n                el.innerHTML = generators[type]();\n                tunnel.appendChild(el);\n\n                // Math for positioning around the tunnel walls\n                const angle = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n                // Leave a clear center path, place panels on the \"walls\"\n                const radiusX = (window.innerWidth < 768 ? 200 : 350) + Math.random() * 400;\n                const radiusY = (window.innerWidth < 768 ? 150 : 250) + Math.random() * 300;\n\n                const x = Math.cos(angle) * radiusX;\n                const y = Math.sin(angle) * radiusY;\n                const z = -Math.random() * maxDepth;\n\n                panels.push({ el, x, y, z });\n            }\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            let speed = 1.2;\n            const cameraZ = 300; // Point where panels pass the screen\n\n            function animate() {\n                panels.forEach(p => {\n                    p.z += speed;\n\n                    // Reset to back of tunnel if passed camera\n                    if (p.z > cameraZ) {\n                        p.z -= maxDepth + cameraZ;\n                    }\n\n                    // Calculate visual properties based on depth\n                    const distance = Math.abs(p.z);\n\n                    // Blur: distant objects are blurry\n                    let blur = 0;\n                    if (p.z < -1000) {\n                        blur = (-p.z - 1000) / 400; // Max blur around 5px-8px\n                    }\n                    blur = Math.min(6, blur); // Cap blur for performance\n\n                    // Opacity: Fade in from back, fade out as it hits camera\n                    let opacity = 1;\n                    if (p.z < -3000) {\n                        opacity = Math.max(0, 1 - ((-p.z - 3000) / 1000)); // Fade in at far end\n                    } else if (p.z > 0) {\n                        opacity = Math.max(0, 1 - (p.z / cameraZ)); // Fade out near camera\n                    }\n\n                    // Apply styles via string concatenation for performance\n                    p.el.style.transform = `translate(-50%, -50%) translate3d(${p.x}px, ${p.y}px, ${p.z}px)`;\n                    p.el.style.filter = blur > 0.1 ? `blur(${blur.toFixed(1)}px)` : 'none';\n                    p.el.style.opacity = opacity.toFixed(2);\n                    // z-index based on depth to ensure proper stacking order despite 3D transform quirks in some browsers\n                    p.el.style.zIndex = Math.round(p.z + maxDepth);\n                });\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            }\n\n            // Start animation\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n\n            // Mouse Parallax Effect\n            let mouseX = 0;\n            let mouseY = 0;\n            let targetX = 50;\n            let targetY = 50;\n\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                // Normalize mouse position between -1 and 1\n                const x = (e.clientX / window.innerWidth - 0.5) * 2;\n                const y = (e.clientY / window.innerHeight - 0.5) * 2;\n\n                // Map to percentage for perspective-origin (50% is center, move slightly off center)\n                mouseX = 50 + (x * 15);\n                mouseY = 50 + (y * 15);\n            });\n\n            function updateParallax() {\n                // Smooth easing\n                targetX += (mouseX - targetX) * 0.05;\n                targetY += (mouseY - targetY) * 0.05;\n\n                scene.style.perspectiveOrigin = `${targetX.toFixed(2)}% ${targetY.toFixed(2)}%`;\n                requestAnimationFrame(updateParallax);\n            }\n\n            // Only run parallax on desktop\n            if (window.innerWidth >= 768) {\n                requestAnimationFrame(updateParallax);\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "deep-view-infrastructure.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/deep-view-infrastructure.jpg", "source_name": "deep-view-infrastructure-DESIGN.md", "views": 146, "forks": 10, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T22:07:09.42327+00:00"}